A1 L2: on a quicktest throwaway map, one colonist on an ordered Goto (glasswalk slip off) crosses 12 cells of TileGranite at its own 60/MoveSpeed ticks/cell (+-0.75) and 12 cells of RM_Glasswalk 3 (+-0.75) ticks/cell slower, timed with exact step_game_ticks steps, so a 13 ticks/cell pawn moves at 13/16 = 0.81 on glasswalk (spec ~80%)
